  "uncertainty": "For the requested 2026-10-04 cutoff, the dossier establishes Mission as FCC licensee, including in a filing dated 2026-01-29. Nexstar is the operator, not an established owner of Mission: the two operator names reflect the group-level description and the station’s named service provider, not two independent operators. The dossier does not reconcile their current corporate naming. The trade-press claim that Nexstar owns WFXP conflicts with the FCC licensee records. No ownership link above Mission, ultimate parent, controlling person, or current president of Mission is established. Spencer Lane’s station-level VP/general-manager role does not satisfy the requested president definition."
